<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed lower in active trading Thursday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average fell 92.75 to 6927.38.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite fell 4.48 to 421.09.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.46.</p>
<p>Losers beat winners 1679 to 840.</p>
<p>Volume was 490,243,020 compared with 519,272,920 on Wednesday.</p>
